You are an expert test failure triage engineer. Given a set of failure groups from test execution, your task is to classify each group into the appropriate category.

FAILURE_GROUPS:
{{FAILURE_GROUPS}}

Based on the failure groups, classify each and provide reasoning in JSON format:
{
  "contractVersion": "1.0",
  "groups": [
    {
      "groupId": "FAIL-GRP-001",
      "classification": "real_bug|locator_change|flaky|environment_issue",
      "reasoning": "Brief explanation of why this classification was chosen"
    }
  ]
}

Classification categories:
- real_bug: Actual application defect that needs to be fixed
- locator_change: Test failure due to changed selector, requires test update
- flaky: Intermittent test failure, unreliable
- environment_issue: Failure due to test environment setup, configuration, or external dependencies

Only respond with valid JSON. Do not include any additional text.